'''No Plan A (Deadly)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]] and appears on the '''7th''', '''8th''', '''21st''', and '''22nd''' of every month. When clearing the stage, there is a chance to unlock [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Catway]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is a permanent stage unlocked after clearing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]].

